{"4737900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Onigokko", "steam_appid": 4737900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5026210], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Onigokko is an online game of tag gone haunted: little white ghosts hide, flee and possess furniture while one BIG angry Granny hunts them down with a crowbar. Get caught? Congratulations — YOU might be the Granny now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strictly multiplayer: 2–10 players, no bots, no NPCs. Two of you is already a game; ten of you is total chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The rules are simple</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round one player becomes the Granny. Everyone else is a ghost. Ghosts scatter and hide — behind doors, in dark corners, or INSIDE the furniture: possess a chair, a trash can or a beach ball and sit perfectly still. The Granny smashes everything that looks suspicious.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PAINT TO HIDE<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4737900/extras/488668f7f2bebff3acebb6d51a39b6b6.poster.avif?t=1787670463\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4737900/extras/488668f7f2bebff3acebb6d51a39b6b6.webm?t=1787670463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4737900/extras/488668f7f2bebff3acebb6d51a39b6b6.mp4?t=1787670463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAP GHOSTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4737900/extras/439fbb8b62128a3b25d8ed63e07c944c.poster.avif?t=1787670463\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4737900/extras/439fbb8b62128a3b25d8ed63e07c944c.webm?t=1787670463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4737900/extras/439fbb8b62128a3b25d8ed63e07c944c.mp4?t=1787670463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two ways to play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAG</strong> — get caught and you swap places with the Granny. Nobody sits out, highest score wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFECTION</strong> — caught ghosts join the Granny's side. Survive until the timer runs out to win.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Say nothing. Or scream.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity  voice chat: the closer the Granny gets, the better she hears you. Whisper your plans, betray your friends, get found because you laughed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made for game nights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for 2–10 players — paroled or public   servers anyone can join</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short rounds, one click to change modes — the host configures everything in the lobby</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever played tag or hide-and-seek, you already know how to play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About videos &amp; streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are welcome! Please include the game's name in your video title.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Onigokko is an online game of tag gone haunted: little white ghosts hide, flee and possess furniture while one BIG angry Granny hunts them down with a crowbar. Get caught? Congratulations — YOU might be the Granny now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strictly multiplayer: 2–10 players, no bots, no NPCs. Two of you is already a game; ten of you is total chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The rules are simple</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph