ass=\"bb_tag\" >Say nothing. Or scream.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity  voice chat: the closer the Granny gets, the better she hears you. Whisper your plans, betray your friends, get found because you laughed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made for game nights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for 2–10 players — paroled or public   servers anyone can join</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short rounds, one click to change modes — the host configures everything in the lobby</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever played tag or hide-and-seek, you already know how to play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About videos &amp; streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are welcome! Please include the game's name in your video title.</p>", "short_description": "Hide &amp; seek meets TAG for 2–10 players, online only: ghosts possess furniture and paint themselves to blend in while one furious Granny hunts them down. Get caught — YOU'RE the Granny now. Hide. Paint. Run. Laugh.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4737900/e49aff38ff87759065cbe0ab10941e68a151faed/header.jpg?t=1787670463", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4737900/7b6563c3dbff1de50d348ac2c6c377fb6833c6bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787670463", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4737900/7b6563c3dbff1de50d348ac2c6c377fb6833c6bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787670463", "website": "https://gameborn.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><str